{
  "body_human_readable": "As of Thursday, July 16, 2026, the weather in Kyiv, Ukraine is sunny and clear.\n\nThe temperature is approximately 24-27\u00b0C (75-81\u00b0F). Some sources report a \"feels like\" temperature of around 27\u00b0C (80\u00b0F).\n\nThe wind is blowing from the north at a speed of about 10 to 12 km/h (6 to 7.5 mph). There is a low chance of precipitation. The humidity is around 44%.\n\nThe skies are expected to remain clear to partly cloudy throughout the day.",
